//! The `column-rule-inset-junction-end` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! property can be used to offset the bottom endpoints of column rule segments that are [junction
//! endpoints](#understanding_junction_endpoints); that is, endpoints at gap junctions where rule
//! segments intersect.
